{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fast-paced, dark apocalyptic-style zombie shooter game that poses a relative challenge. It demands players' focused attention and quick reflexes, requiring them to maneuver deftly while shooting and drawing their blades. Drawing a blade can block zombie bullets. Each time you eliminate a zombie, there's a chance to drop a random weapon pack. Obtaining a random weapon pack grants access to super weapons. Defeat zombies and experience the thrill of unleashing super weapons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959110/extras/695a4d966bbb6af186533716e9bbaab6.poster.avif?t=1765193073\" width=600 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959110/extras/695a4d966bbb6af186533716e9bbaab6.webm?t=1765193073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959110/extras/695a4d966bbb6af186533716e9bbaab6.mp4?t=1765193073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959110/extras/26e408a5c4185400e7a2526ccd8621c2.poster.avif?t=1765193073\" width=600 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959110/extras/26e408a5c4185400e7a2526ccd8621c2.webm?t=1765193073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959110/extras/26e408a5c4185400e7a2526ccd8621c2.mp4?t=1765193073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Champion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3959